{"words": [{"text": "فَمَنِ", "translation": "Then whoever"}, {"text": "ٱفْتَرَىٰ", "translation": "fabricates"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "translation": "[the] lie"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "then those "}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ", "translation": "(are) the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And whoever invents about Allāh untruth after that - then those are [truly] the wrongdoers."}